<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Search Report Process: 6 Steps</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Trademark search is conducted entirely online via the IP India Public Search portal. No visit to the Trade Marks Registry is required. Patron delivers reports remotely for Delhi businesses across all sectors.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
